{
  "slug": "parrot",
  "name": "Parrot",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Kills self-repetition in LLM responses. Cuts 30-40% wasted tokens by eliminating restated questions, echoed instructions, recap paragraphs, and repeated ideas. Supports three intensity levels (lite, full, off) switchable via /parrot command. Auto-activates every session via SessionStart hook. Works with Claude Code's plugin system — install via claude plugin marketplace add animeshpatni94/parrot then claude plugin install parrot@parrot. Stacks with other skills like caveman for up to 80% token reduction.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `parrot` (Kills self-repetition in LLM responses).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install parrot@claude-community` from `animeshpatni94/parrot`.\n\nLLM already said it. Why say again?\n\nKills self-repetition in LLM responses. Cuts 30-40% wasted tokens by eliminating restated questions, echoed instructions, recap paragraphs, and repeated ideas. Supports three intensity levels (lite, full, off) switchable via /parrot command. Auto-activates every session via SessionStart hook. Works with Claude Code's plugin system — install via claude plugin marketplace add animeshpatni94/parrot then claude plugin install parrot@parrot. Stacks with other skills like caveman for up to 80% token reduction.",
